                    <seg xml:id="KR1j0018_tls_001-p0025a.2">
                        <line>
              【一】，惟初太始，道立於一，造分天地，化成萬物。</line>
                        <tls:ann xmlns:tls="http://hxwd.org/ns/1.0" concept="COSMIC FORCE" concept-id="uuid-7d1cad9e-c289-4065-a2e5-e21cbd3e33df" xml:id="uuid-2d113e46-74a3-4ada-913e-4674a3dada96">
                            <link target="#KR1j0018_tls_001-p0025a.2 #uuid-b2277f1b-2cf8-4e5c-abd4-53ce5ceb183b"/>
                            <tls:text>
                                <tls:srcline title="說文解字" target="#KR1j0018_tls_001-p0025a.2" pos="9">
              【一】，惟初太始，道立於一，造分天地，化成萬物。</tls:srcline>
                                <tls:line title="Translation of 說文解字 into (English)" transl-id="KR1j0018-en-598cdd0c" src="C.Harbsmeier">ONE is the opening Great Beginning. The Way is established on the one, and by way of creative innovation it divided Heaven from Earth so as to transform and complete the myriad kind of things.</tls:line>
                            </tls:text>
                            <form corresp="#uuid-012329d2-8a81-4a4f-ac3a-03885a49d6d6" orig="">
                                <orth>道</orth>
                                <pron xml:lang="zh-Latn-x-pinyin">dào</pron>
                            </form>
                            <sense corresp="#uuid-b2277f1b-2cf8-4e5c-abd4-53ce5ceb183b">
                                <gramGrp>
                    <pos>N</pos>
  <tls:syn-func corresp="#uuid-76be1df4-3d73-4e5f-bbc2-729542645bc8">nab</tls:syn-func>
  <tls:sem-feat corresp="#uuid-887fdec5-f18d-4faf-8602-f5c5c2f99a1d">metaphysical</tls:sem-feat>
                </gramGrp>
                                <def>the Way as a cosmic force in the universe</def>
                            </sense>
                            <tls:metadata resp="#CH" created="2024-01-16T22:14:22.491+09:00">
                                <respStmt>
